        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\n&#39; --- A4-HOCHFORMAT OPTIMIERUNG ---\nskinparam maxMessageSize 160\nskinparam BoxPadding 5\nskinparam ParticipantPadding 8\nskinparam FontSize 11\nskinparam ArrowFontSize 10\n\ntitle Kategorie: Users / Experten (DIN A4)\n\nautonumber\nactor Client\nparticipant \&quot;Next.js API\&quot; as API\nparticipant \&quot;Expert Logic\&quot; as Logic\ndatabase PostgreSQL as DB\n\n== 1. Experten listen (GET /api/users/list) ==\nClient -&gt; API : GET /api/users/list\nAPI -&gt; Logic : getListOfPeople...()\nLogic -&gt; DB : JOIN Expert, Org &amp; Fields\nDB --&gt; Logic : Expertenliste\nLogic --&gt; API : experts[]\nAPI --&gt; Client : 200 OK { success, experts }\n\n== 2. Experte erstellen (POST /api/users/create) ==\nClient -&gt; API : POST /api/users/create\\n{ name, prename, email, ... }\nAPI -&gt; Logic : addExpert(body)\nLogic -&gt; Logic : getOrgIdByName()\nalt Org existiert nicht\n    Logic -&gt; Logic : addOrganization()\n    Logic -&gt; DB : INSERT INTO Organization\n    DB --&gt; Logic : organization_id\nend\nLogic -&gt; DB : INSERT INTO Expert\nDB --&gt; Logic : expertId\nopt expertFields vorhanden\n    Logic -&gt; Logic : addExpertFields()\n    Logic -&gt; DB : INSERT INTO ExpertField\nend\nLogic --&gt; API : { expertId, fieldsAdded }\nAPI --&gt; Client : 200 OK { success, expertId }\n\n== 3. Experte aktualisieren (PATCH /api/users/update) ==\nClient -&gt; API : PATCH /api/users/update\\n{ expert_id, primary_org, ... }\nAPI -&gt; Logic : updateExpert(id, body)\nopt Neue primary_org angegeben\n    Logic -&gt; Logic : getOrgId / addOrg\nend\nLogic -&gt; DB : UPDATE Expert (COALESCE)\nDB --&gt; Logic : Expert-Objekt\nLogic --&gt; API : data\nAPI --&gt; Client : 200 OK { success, data }\n\n== 4. Experte löschen (DELETE /api/users/delete) ==\nClient -&gt; API : DELETE /api/users/delete\\n{ expert_id }\nAPI -&gt; Logic : deleteExpert(id)\nLogic -&gt; DB : DELETE FROM Expert...\nDB --&gt; Logic : boolean\nalt Löschen erfolgreich\n    Logic --&gt; API : true\n    API --&gt; Client : 200 OK { success: true }\nelse ID nicht vorhanden\n    Logic --&gt; API : false\n    API --&gt; Client : 404 Not Found { error }\nend\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="NjsBhPzeLoGm2V9BRYTy-56">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
